    "Sidebar: two modes via the switch at the top. Connections lists saved connections; Tables shows the object tree of the connected database with a filter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sidebar: two modes via the switch at the top. Connections lists saved connections; Tables shows the object tree of the connected database with a filter."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "侧边栏:通过顶部切换在两种模式间切换。「连接」列出已保存的连接,「表」显示所连数据库的对象树并支持筛选。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "側邊欄:透過頂部切換在兩種模式間切換。「連線」列出已保存的連線,「表」顯示所連資料庫的物件樹並支援篩選。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "側邊欄:透過頂部切換在兩種模式間切換。「連線」列出已保存的連線,「表」顯示所連資料庫的物件樹並支援篩選。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "側邊欄:透過頂部切換在兩種模式間切換。「連線」列出已保存的連線,「表」顯示所連資料庫的物件樹並支援篩選。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
